  "solution": "**Logic: [(Second no. × 4)] : [Second no.] : [(Second no. × 2)]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**1016 ∶ 254 ∶ 508 →**\n\n​⇒ [(254 × 4)] : [254] : [(254 × 2)]\n\n**2200 ∶ 550 ∶ 1100 →**\n\n​⇒ [(550 × 4)] : [550] : [(550 × 2)]\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**(1) **5700 ∶ 1450 ∶ 2800 →\n\n​⇒ [(1450 × 4) - 100] : [1450] : [(1450 × 2) - 100]\n\n**(2) **160 ∶ 40 ∶ 60 →\n\n​⇒ [(40 × 4)] : [40] : [(40 × 2) - 20]\n\n**(3) **5400 ∶ 1350 ∶ 2700 →\n\n​⇒ [(1350 × **4**)] : [1350] : [(1350 × **2**)]\n\n**(4) **3400 ∶ 852 ∶ 1600 →\n\n​⇒ [(852 × 4) - 8] : [852] : [(852 × 2) - 104]\n\nHere, **'5400 ∶ 1350 ∶ 2700' **is similar to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n8a:Tf2c,\n\nतर्क:",
